  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Assistance alimentaire d&#x2019;urgence au Nord-Kivu</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of this project is to provide life-saving food security assistance to internally displaced persons and host community members in Goma, Lubero, Masisi, Nyiragongo, and Rutshuru. This WFP project distributes over $1.5 million directly into the hands of those in need via cash transfers. The project provides humanitarian assistance to 25,700 people, including 5,200 women, 4,700 men, 15,800 children, and including 1,400 persons with disabilities.</narrative>
  </description>
